*>   2003-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 859
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0042.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY INT0042C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 APPLIED-RATE       PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM SET-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "APPLIED-RATE=" APPLIED-RATE
    STOP RUN.
SET-TERM-RATE.
    *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE - LIMIT 2.25 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF DEP-TERM-MM >= 1 AND DEP-TERM-MM <= 3
        MOVE 0.0275 TO APPLIED-RATE
    ELSE
        IF DEP-TERM-MM >= 4 AND DEP-TERM-MM <= 18
            MOVE 0.0350 TO APPLIED-RATE
        ELSE
            *> LONG TERM DEPOSIT RATE - LIMIT 30 PER 1998 POLICY
            IF DEP-TERM-MM >= 19 AND DEP-TERM-MM <= 60
                MOVE 0.0425 TO APPLIED-RATE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0.0200 TO APPLIED-RATE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
